  "video_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0",
  "account": "林睿读书&书在橱窗",
  "source_title": "雪玉洞：石头一年长0.33毫米，快普通溶洞三十多倍；本溪水洞：三千米暗河清蓝，叫“地下银河”；万华岩：十四米绝壁藏变色瀑布，暗河源头找了十七年；腾龙洞：八百里清江扎入地下，卧龙吞江，洞藏妖雾山；芙蓉洞：珊瑚瑶池会发光，池底三层，成因至今没定论#中国溶洞 #地质奇观#涨知识#自然奇观#织金洞#大美中国",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_2a12e49667774dc0_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 346.000998,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "有一根石头，保险公司给他投了一个亿，有一池子水科考队蹲在边上看了半个钟头，没人敢动。还有一件东西，外国专家飞来看了三趟，走的时候撂下两个字，不可能他们全藏在咱们中国的地底下，九成九的人，这辈子都不知道他们长什么样。有人说溶洞吗？不就是钟乳石看一一个，等于看全部。我劝您把这话咽回去，看完今天这五个您再说这句话。老规矩，开讲之前，劳驾您点个赞，我看看今天都是哪些老朋友在听第十名，别庆丰都雪鱼洞，这里的石头正在长个子，别的溶洞一百年才长一毫米，他一年就涨零点三三毫米，快了三十多倍。洞里的钟乳石只有有三千三百年到一万年，相当于人类的十三四岁，是个小姑娘。可这小姑娘有个怪脾气，下雨天长得快，旱季长得慢，下雨的时候长得比旱季快八成多。科学家研究了半天，也没完全弄明白，更绝得是洞里面温度恒定。十八度二，水汽永远是饱和的，一根四米高的石墩，一片八米长的石岐，全世界找不到。第二处，您去别处找找，找不着这么年轻的洞。第九名，辽宁本溪水洞三千米，暗河水清的发蓝游船开进去，两岸的钟乳师倒挂着往后退，冷气顺着水面往脸上扑大，夏天的进去也得裹件外套。当地老人讲，这水是从长白山上化下来的雪水。三伏天捧一口喝那个凉劲儿，从嗓子眼儿一路窜到脚后跟。当年地质队进洞勘测的时候，船开出去，两千多米还没到头，队长抬头看着头顶的钟乳石，说了一句，这哪是溶洞？这是地下银河，这名字就这么叫下来了，一直叫到今天这水打哪来的？到今天也没完全弄清楚。第八名，湖南郴州万华岩十四米高的绝壁上面藏着一道会变色的瀑布，科考队，在洞里发现了一条地下暗河，好几公里长，可这水是从哪儿来的，找了十七年没找着。后来美国探险队带着攀岩装备来了，爬上去一看傻了，里面还有洞，还有瀑布，还有更深的暗河。最后探险队员往水里放了绿色和红色的颜料，等了两天，颜料从洞口流出来了才搞清楚，可至今这条暗河还有一大半没人走，通过这道瀑布后面到底还有多深，您自己琢磨琢磨。第七名，湖北恩施腾龙洞八百里清江浩浩荡荡，流到洞口，突然一头扎进地下，消失了，变成了一条十六点八公里长的浮流。这叫卧龙吞江，整条江被一个洞吞进去，全世界找不出第二处可最吓人的地方。在洞里头，有一座山叫妖雾闪山洞里，居然藏着一座山。阴雨天的时候，山被雾气笼罩，跟有妖怪一样。科学家说了，这是洞顶塌了石头堆成的，可老百姓不信，说这山底下压着龙骨腾龙洞的名字，就是这么来的。一条江说，没就没，您说这底下得藏着多大的东西。第六名，重庆五龙芙蓉洞、珊瑚瑶池面积三十二平方米，水深八十厘米。池底分三层，最上面一层像云雾一样蓬松，像球现式颗粒，中间一层像白玉一样薄，每层只有零点一毫米。第三层像珊瑚一样伸展开，全世界找不出第二处。为什么能长成这样？科学家研究了半天，说是水温差异是镁元素是晶体结构，可到底怎么形成的，到现在也没一个定论。当年最先发现他的那支科考队，有个队员后来回忆说，手电筒往水面一照，整个池子像活了一样在发光。全队人蹲在池子边上看了半个多钟头，没有一个人能萝布水滴的几百万年才攒出这么一池子头，一个看见他的居然是这帮人，这运气上哪说理去？从第十到第六，雪玉洞的石头是个小姑娘，本溪水洞飘着一条地下银河，万花岩的瀑布会变色，腾龙洞吞了一整条江，芙蓉洞的池子会发光。可这五个还不是秘密最多的。接下来第五道第一，一个比一个狠，有一根石头值一个亿，有一片瀑布是石头长的。还有一件东西，科学家到今天都定不了他的成因，他是哪儿，他凭什么排第一下集马上更新，您先点个关注点开头像别走丢。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 1170,
      "text": "有一根石头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1750,
      "end_ms": 3510,
      "text": "保险公司给他投了一个亿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00003",
      "start_ms": 4210,
      "end_ms": 8430,
      "text": "有一池子水科考队蹲在边上看了半个钟头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00004",
      "start_ms": 9050,
      "end_ms": 9930,
      "text": "没人敢动。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00005",
      "start_ms": 10850,
      "end_ms": 12030,
      "text": "还有一件东西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00006",
      "start_ms": 12910,
      "end_ms": 14970,
      "text": "外国专家飞来看了三趟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00007",
      "start_ms": 15350,
      "end_ms": 17310,
      "text": "走的时候撂下两个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00008",
      "start_ms": 18170,
      "end_ms": 21930,
      "text": "不可能他们全藏在咱们中国的地底下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00009",
      "start_ms": 22890,
      "end_ms": 23990,
      "text": "九成九的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00010",
      "start_ms": 23990,
      "end_ms": 25830,
      "text": "这辈子都不知道他们长什么样。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00011",
      "start_ms": 26150,
      "end_ms": 27510,
      "text": "有人说溶洞吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00012",
      "start_ms": 27950,
      "end_ms": 30440,
      "text": "不就是钟乳石看一一个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00013",
      "start_ms": 30440,
      "end_ms": 31660,
      "text": "等于看全部。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00014",
      "start_ms": 32020,
      "end_ms": 34000,
      "text": "我劝您把这话咽回去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00015",
      "start_ms": 34640,
      "end_ms": 37420,
      "text": "看完今天这五个您再说这句话。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00016",
      "start_ms": 37520,
      "end_ms": 38119,
      "text": "老规矩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00017",
      "start_ms": 38440,
      "end_ms": 39300,
      "text": "开讲之前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00018",
      "start_ms": 39300,
      "end_ms": 40400,
      "text": "劳驾您点个赞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00019",
      "start_ms": 40480,
      "end_ms": 43640,
      "text": "我看看今天都是哪些老朋友在听第十名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00020",
      "start_ms": 44540,
      "end_ms": 46319,
      "text": "别庆丰都雪鱼洞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00021",
      "start_ms": 47080,
      "end_ms": 49200,
      "text": "这里的石头正在长个子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00022",
      "start_ms": 49700,
      "end_ms": 52360,
      "text": "别的溶洞一百年才长一毫米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00023",
      "start_ms": 53040,
      "end_ms": 55600,
      "text": "他一年就涨零点三三毫米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00024",
      "start_ms": 56320,
      "end_ms": 57460,
      "text": "快了三十多倍。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00025",
      "start_ms": 58160,
      "end_ms": 62055,
      "text": "洞里的钟乳石只有有三千三百年到一万年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00026",
      "start_ms": 62780,
      "end_ms": 65175,
      "text": "相当于人类的十三四岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00027",
      "start_ms": 65590,
      "end_ms": 66405,
      "text": "是个小姑娘。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00028",
      "start_ms": 67090,
      "end_ms": 69065,
      "text": "可这小姑娘有个怪脾气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00029",
      "start_ms": 69540,
      "end_ms": 70840,
      "text": "下雨天长得快，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00030",
      "start_ms": 71100,
      "end_ms": 72355,
      "text": "旱季长得慢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00031",
      "start_ms": 72940,
      "end_ms": 75660,
      "text": "下雨的时候长得比旱季快八成多。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00032",
      "start_ms": 75800,
      "end_ms": 77225,
      "text": "科学家研究了半天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00033",
      "start_ms": 77490,
      "end_ms": 79025,
      "text": "也没完全弄明白，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00034",
      "start_ms": 79530,
      "end_ms": 82500,
      "text": "更绝得是洞里面温度恒定。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00035",
      "start_ms": 82580,
      "end_ms": 83375,
      "text": "十八度二，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00036",
      "start_ms": 83830,
      "end_ms": 85855,
      "text": "水汽永远是饱和的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00037",
      "start_ms": 86230,
      "end_ms": 88105,
      "text": "一根四米高的石墩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00038",
      "start_ms": 88470,
      "end_ms": 90215,
      "text": "一片八米长的石岐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00039",
      "start_ms": 90770,
      "end_ms": 91890,
      "text": "全世界找不到。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00040",
      "start_ms": 91890,
      "end_ms": 92510,
      "text": "第二处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00041",
      "start_ms": 92750,
      "end_ms": 94105,
      "text": "您去别处找找，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00042",
      "start_ms": 94400,
      "end_ms": 95875,
      "text": "找不着这么年轻的洞。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00043",
      "start_ms": 96260,
      "end_ms": 96865,
      "text": "第九名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00044",
      "start_ms": 97390,
      "end_ms": 100190,
      "text": "辽宁本溪水洞三千米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00045",
      "start_ms": 100190,
      "end_ms": 104035,
      "text": "暗河水清的发蓝游船开进去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00046",
      "start_ms": 104460,
      "end_ms": 106735,
      "text": "两岸的钟乳师倒挂着往后退，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00047",
      "start_ms": 107050,
      "end_ms": 110060,
      "text": "冷气顺着水面往脸上扑大，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00048",
      "start_ms": 110060,
      "end_ms": 112350,
      "text": "夏天的进去也得裹件外套。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00049",
      "start_ms": 112490,
      "end_ms": 113445,
      "text": "当地老人讲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00050",
      "start_ms": 114410,
      "end_ms": 117805,
      "text": "这水是从长白山上化下来的雪水。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00051",
      "start_ms": 118370,
      "end_ms": 121740,
      "text": "三伏天捧一口喝那个凉劲儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00052",
      "start_ms": 121740,
      "end_ms": 124235,
      "text": "从嗓子眼儿一路窜到脚后跟。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00053",
      "start_ms": 124980,
      "end_ms": 127755,
      "text": "当年地质队进洞勘测的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00054",
      "start_ms": 128170,
      "end_ms": 128970,
      "text": "船开出去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00055",
      "start_ms": 128970,
      "end_ms": 130465,
      "text": "两千多米还没到头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00056",
      "start_ms": 130980,
      "end_ms": 133735,
      "text": "队长抬头看着头顶的钟乳石，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00057",
      "start_ms": 134100,
      "end_ms": 134815,
      "text": "说了一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00058",
      "start_ms": 135190,
      "end_ms": 136155,
      "text": "这哪是溶洞？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00059",
      "start_ms": 136560,
      "end_ms": 138025,
      "text": "这是地下银河，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00060",
      "start_ms": 138490,
      "end_ms": 140245,
      "text": "这名字就这么叫下来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00061",
      "start_ms": 140830,
      "end_ms": 144125,
      "text": "一直叫到今天这水打哪来的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00062",
      "start_ms": 144400,
      "end_ms": 146425,
      "text": "到今天也没完全弄清楚。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00063",
      "start_ms": 147500,
      "end_ms": 148045,
      "text": "第八名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00064",
      "start_ms": 149350,
      "end_ms": 156505,
      "text": "湖南郴州万华岩十四米高的绝壁上面藏着一道会变色的瀑布，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00065",
      "start_ms": 157100,
      "end_ms": 157740,
      "text": "科考队，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00066",
      "start_ms": 157920,
      "end_ms": 160835,
      "text": "在洞里发现了一条地下暗河，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00067",
      "start_ms": 161320,
      "end_ms": 162285,
      "text": "好几公里长，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00068",
      "start_ms": 163020,
      "end_ms": 164785,
      "text": "可这水是从哪儿来的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00069",
      "start_ms": 165380,
      "end_ms": 166745,
      "text": "找了十七年没找着。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00070",
      "start_ms": 167590,
      "end_ms": 170585,
      "text": "后来美国探险队带着攀岩装备来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00071",
      "start_ms": 170870,
      "end_ms": 172805,
      "text": "爬上去一看傻了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00072",
      "start_ms": 173180,
      "end_ms": 174035,
      "text": "里面还有洞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00073",
      "start_ms": 174310,
      "end_ms": 175085,
      "text": "还有瀑布，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00074",
      "start_ms": 175420,
      "end_ms": 176925,
      "text": "还有更深的暗河。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00075",
      "start_ms": 177760,
      "end_ms": 182065,
      "text": "最后探险队员往水里放了绿色和红色的颜料，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00076",
      "start_ms": 182530,
      "end_ms": 183335,
      "text": "等了两天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00077",
      "start_ms": 183720,
      "end_ms": 187145,
      "text": "颜料从洞口流出来了才搞清楚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00078",
      "start_ms": 187660,
      "end_ms": 191580,
      "text": "可至今这条暗河还有一大半没人走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00079",
      "start_ms": 191580,
      "end_ms": 195815,
      "text": "通过这道瀑布后面到底还有多深，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00080",
      "start_ms": 196650,
      "end_ms": 198050,
      "text": "您自己琢磨琢磨。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00081",
      "start_ms": 198130,
      "end_ms": 198770,
      "text": "第七名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00082",
      "start_ms": 199010,
      "end_ms": 203030,
      "text": "湖北恩施腾龙洞八百里清江浩浩荡荡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00083",
      "start_ms": 203030,
      "end_ms": 203830,
      "text": "流到洞口，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00084",
      "start_ms": 203930,
      "end_ms": 205525,
      "text": "突然一头扎进地下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00085",
      "start_ms": 205820,
      "end_ms": 206465,
      "text": "消失了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00086",
      "start_ms": 206700,
      "end_ms": 209675,
      "text": "变成了一条十六点八公里长的浮流。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00087",
      "start_ms": 210030,
      "end_ms": 211565,
      "text": "这叫卧龙吞江，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00088",
      "start_ms": 211950,
      "end_ms": 214365,
      "text": "整条江被一个洞吞进去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00089",
      "start_ms": 214820,
      "end_ms": 218140,
      "text": "全世界找不出第二处可最吓人的地方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00090",
      "start_ms": 218140,
      "end_ms": 218900,
      "text": "在洞里头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00091",
      "start_ms": 219160,
      "end_ms": 222670,
      "text": "有一座山叫妖雾闪山洞里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00092",
      "start_ms": 222670,
      "end_ms": 224130,
      "text": "居然藏着一座山。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00093",
      "start_ms": 224410,
      "end_ms": 225550,
      "text": "阴雨天的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00094",
      "start_ms": 225710,
      "end_ms": 227145,
      "text": "山被雾气笼罩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00095",
      "start_ms": 227420,
      "end_ms": 228565,
      "text": "跟有妖怪一样。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00096",
      "start_ms": 229030,
      "end_ms": 229970,
      "text": "科学家说了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00097",
      "start_ms": 230190,
      "end_ms": 232805,
      "text": "这是洞顶塌了石头堆成的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00098",
      "start_ms": 233750,
      "end_ms": 234795,
      "text": "可老百姓不信，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00099",
      "start_ms": 235210,
      "end_ms": 238430,
      "text": "说这山底下压着龙骨腾龙洞的名字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00100",
      "start_ms": 238430,
      "end_ms": 239375,
      "text": "就是这么来的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00101",
      "start_ms": 239880,
      "end_ms": 240700,
      "text": "一条江说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00102",
      "start_ms": 240700,
      "end_ms": 241360,
      "text": "没就没，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00103",
      "start_ms": 241660,
      "end_ms": 244060,
      "text": "您说这底下得藏着多大的东西。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00104",
      "start_ms": 244700,
      "end_ms": 245380,
      "text": "第六名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00105",
      "start_ms": 245740,
      "end_ms": 250280,
      "text": "重庆五龙芙蓉洞、珊瑚瑶池面积三十二平方米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00106",
      "start_ms": 250760,
      "end_ms": 252080,
      "text": "水深八十厘米。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00107",
      "start_ms": 252380,
      "end_ms": 253880,
      "text": "池底分三层，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00108",
      "start_ms": 254280,
      "end_ms": 257520,
      "text": "最上面一层像云雾一样蓬松，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00109",
      "start_ms": 257960,
      "end_ms": 259560,
      "text": "像球现式颗粒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00110",
      "start_ms": 259680,
      "end_ms": 262420,
      "text": "中间一层像白玉一样薄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00111",
      "start_ms": 262940,
      "end_ms": 265180,
      "text": "每层只有零点一毫米。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00112",
      "start_ms": 265580,
      "end_ms": 268360,
      "text": "第三层像珊瑚一样伸展开，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00113",
      "start_ms": 268800,
      "end_ms": 270770,
      "text": "全世界找不出第二处。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00114",
      "start_ms": 272130,
      "end_ms": 274010,
      "text": "为什么能长成这样？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00115",
      "start_ms": 274470,
      "end_ms": 275930,
      "text": "科学家研究了半天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00116",
      "start_ms": 276110,
      "end_ms": 279630,
      "text": "说是水温差异是镁元素是晶体结构，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00117",
      "start_ms": 280110,
      "end_ms": 281970,
      "text": "可到底怎么形成的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00118",
      "start_ms": 282090,
      "end_ms": 284130,
      "text": "到现在也没一个定论。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00119",
      "start_ms": 284950,
      "end_ms": 287650,
      "text": "当年最先发现他的那支科考队，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00120",
      "start_ms": 288150,
      "end_ms": 289750,
      "text": "有个队员后来回忆说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00121",
      "start_ms": 290110,
      "end_ms": 291910,
      "text": "手电筒往水面一照，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00122",
      "start_ms": 292450,
      "end_ms": 294950,
      "text": "整个池子像活了一样在发光。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00123",
      "start_ms": 295510,
      "end_ms": 298610,
      "text": "全队人蹲在池子边上看了半个多钟头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00124",
      "start_ms": 298790,
      "end_ms": 303580,
      "text": "没有一个人能萝布水滴的几百万年才攒出这么一池子头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00125",
      "start_ms": 303580,
      "end_ms": 305505,
      "text": "一个看见他的居然是这帮人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00126",
      "start_ms": 305880,
      "end_ms": 307325,
      "text": "这运气上哪说理去？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00127",
      "start_ms": 307780,
      "end_ms": 309205,
      "text": "从第十到第六，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00128",
      "start_ms": 309690,
      "end_ms": 311595,
      "text": "雪玉洞的石头是个小姑娘，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00129",
      "start_ms": 312050,
      "end_ms": 314915,
      "text": "本溪水洞飘着一条地下银河，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00130",
      "start_ms": 315480,
      "end_ms": 317155,
      "text": "万花岩的瀑布会变色，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00131",
      "start_ms": 317630,
      "end_ms": 319475,
      "text": "腾龙洞吞了一整条江，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00132",
      "start_ms": 319880,
      "end_ms": 321615,
      "text": "芙蓉洞的池子会发光。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00133",
      "start_ms": 322200,
      "end_ms": 324580,
      "text": "可这五个还不是秘密最多的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00134",
      "start_ms": 324580,
      "end_ms": 326280,
      "text": "接下来第五道第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00135",
      "start_ms": 326400,
      "end_ms": 327485,
      "text": "一个比一个狠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00136",
      "start_ms": 327840,
      "end_ms": 329720,
      "text": "有一根石头值一个亿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00137",
      "start_ms": 329860,
      "end_ms": 331715,
      "text": "有一片瀑布是石头长的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00138",
      "start_ms": 332430,
      "end_ms": 333415,
      "text": "还有一件东西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00139",
      "start_ms": 333820,
      "end_ms": 336475,
      "text": "科学家到今天都定不了他的成因，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00140",
      "start_ms": 337320,
      "end_ms": 338075,
      "text": "他是哪儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00141",
      "start_ms": 338740,
      "end_ms": 342245,
      "text": "他凭什么排第一下集马上更新，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2a12e49667774dc0_s00142",
      "start_ms": 342690,
      "end_ms": 345885,
      "text": "您先点个关注点开头像别走丢。"
    }
  ],
